{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-doc-page-tsx","path":"/ja/docs/linux/asahi/","result":{"data":{"jaenPage":{"id":"JaenPage 706c8df4-7a93-5023-93ba-2266bf3f6390","createdAt":"2026-08-12T08:32:43.942Z","modifiedAt":"2026-08-12T08:32:43.942Z","buildPath":"/ja/docs/linux/asahi/","slug":"asahi","template":"JaenTemplate DocPage","excludedFromIndex":false,"jaenPageMetadata":{"title":"Asahi デスクトップのセットアップ","image":"https://netsnek.com/images/docs/docs.jpg","description":"MacBook Pro の上に Wayfire と XFCE で Wayland デスクトップをどう組み上げたか、そして道中で私を捕まえたつまずきの石について。","blogPost":{"date":"2024-11-29","author":null,"category":"Apple Silicon 上の Linux"}},"pageConfig":{"label":"DocPage","childTemplates":["JaenTemplate DocPage"],"withoutJaenFrameStickyHeader":true},"jaenFields":{"IMA:MdxField":{"documentation":{"value":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Asahi デスクトップのセットアップ","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":3,"offset":3},"end":{"line":2,"column":22,"offset":22}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1,"offset":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":22,"offset":22}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"私のデスクトップは、既製品としてはどこにも存在しない組み合わせです。Wayland コンポジターとして Wayfire、その上にデスクトップ環境として XFCE 4.20、そして全体は Asahi カーネルを載せた Fedora 43 の MacBook Pro 上で動きます。Apple GPU は Mesa 経由です。私は Wayfire のコンポジティング効果が欲しく、それでいてパネルや Thunar や設定ダイアログのある慣れ親しんだ XFCE の世界も手放したくありませんでした。この2つは一緒に機能します。ただ、すべての部品がきれいに噛み合うまでには時間がかかりました。その道のりがこのページの内容です。","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1,"offset":24},"end":{"line":4,"column":310,"offset":333}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1,"offset":24},"end":{"line":4,"column":310,"offset":333}}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"スタックの概観","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":4,"offset":338},"end":{"line":6,"column":11,"offset":345}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1,"offset":335},"end":{"line":6,"column":11,"offset":345}}},{"type":"code","lang":null,"meta":null,"value":"greetd + tuigreet\n  └→ startxfce4 --wayland wayfire\n       ├→ Wayfire (Wayland-Compositor, wlroots-basiert)\n       ├→ xfce4-session\n       ├→ xfce4-panel (gepatcht: gtk-layer-shell)\n       ├→ xfdesktop (gepatcht: Wayland-Monitornamen)\n       └→ nm-applet, swayidle","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1,"offset":347},"end":{"line":16,"column":4,"offset":619}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"役割分担はこうです。Wayfire がコンポジティング、ウィンドウ管理、エフェクトを担当します。XFCE がセッション管理、パネル、デスクトップ、設定、そしてアプリケーションを提供します。その際 XFCE は Wayland セッションとして Wayfire の上で直接起動します。","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1,"offset":621},"end":{"line":18,"column":142,"offset":762}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1,"offset":621},"end":{"line":18,"column":142,"offset":762}}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"ログイン: greetd + tuigreet","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":4,"offset":767},"end":{"line":20,"column":27,"offset":790}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1,"offset":764},"end":{"line":20,"column":27,"offset":790}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"重いディスプレイマネージャーは使いたくありませんでした。テキストベースのグリーター tuigreet と組み合わせた greetd は最小限で高速、しかも独自のグラフィックセッションを必要としません。","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1,"offset":792},"end":{"line":22,"column":101,"offset":892}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"/etc/greetd/config.toml","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":101,"offset":892},"end":{"line":22,"column":126,"offset":917}}},{"type":"text","value":" にある私の設定です。","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":126,"offset":917},"end":{"line":22,"column":137,"offset":928}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1,"offset":792},"end":{"line":22,"column":137,"offset":928}}},{"type":"code","lang":"toml","meta":null,"value":"[terminal]\nvt = 7\n\n[default_session]\ncommand = \"tuigreet --time --remember --cmd 'startxfce4 --wayland wayfire'\"\nuser = \"greetd\"","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1,"offset":930},"end":{"line":31,"c